      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "另一方面，空中神宫向训练员表示，\n名将怒涛的数值已经达到\n要填满容器的程度了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83b0ac1946a8afa08fa84f5f4b4a440036a525a1d31c4aabee0019b6e57f0646",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
