    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66007f0acd4301907818e51c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过问题还在后头。\n无论是名将怒涛、好歌剧或空中神宫，\n都必须挑战名为“上限”的那道墙。",
      "source_fingerprint": "936a2e63757721b30f6f30d06963effee19b67bc4539eef6ff7388e9224ed10f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058426.json",
      "json_path": [
