      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:142e876d7e44fbdfe724c922",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "名将怒涛原以为自己带领着好歌剧前进，\n结果却不小心率先抵达终点了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1bc6db5c2f2bfadfb52df8fee789cafd4878ecea4aba1e29bcb61b05835b838",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:951c54ae64a8af8095b00d7b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过这也没什么不好。赢过好歌剧，\n让名将怒涛有信心面对长距离竞赛了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "30ccee77e608484efac0eaa563d98c1b8c86a3ba0e4418e9822538cb9f96edb9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
