    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd1f45fd47426a5c5a4045d4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "3200米的距离果然很长，\n跑在坡道上的脚步十分地沉重……\n名将怒涛最后未能赢过好歌剧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e19114fe68f1619cdc3d058ac59d57ab20282f244d1e6d16f90fe52764d3a3f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
