      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今年一整年的路，都会像这场竞赛一样\n既漫长又困难重重。名将怒涛发誓，\n自己要拼死追随好歌剧的脚步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf45584e44bdb19ef5951e6bf625f4cdc110bc9319f0c45d3bdf8c862787adea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
