      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "名将怒涛的资质获得好歌剧认可。\n为此奋发图强的她漂亮地赢过了好歌剧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac01254ab497743c3620062f7fdf39fced523054c2fac87838c27a788d052c05",
